  "id": "effortfulness",
  "term": "effortfulness",
  "definition": "Effortfulness refers to the increased mental work needed when a signal is hard to extract, such as speech in a complex background. In this view, more cognitive resources are used for basic acoustic and phonological processing, leaving fewer resources available for deeper semantic processing.",
